---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="section intro-section">
    <div class="intro-grid">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <div class="bio-text">
        <p>
          I was born on August 16, 2002. For a long time, I think I was
          still living like I had more than one shot at this — just going
          along with whatever came next instead of actually choosing
          anything. At some point that stopped sitting right with me.
          Nothing dramatic, just a quiet realization that I only get one
          run at this, so I might as well take it seriously.
        </p>
        <p>
          One of the bigger things I've picked up along the way is that
          trying to become a better version of yourself isn't optional —
          it's just part of being a person. I didn't always live like
          that. Coming out of school, I let a lot of other people's
          opinions shape what I thought my career was supposed to look
          like, and I spent a while on paths that were never really mine
          to begin with.
        </p>
        <p>
          What I want now is simple enough to say: I want to build
          something that actually matters, and I want to prove to myself
          that I'm capable of more than I've shown so far. That's mostly
          for my own sake, not anyone else's.
        </p>
        <p>
          The path there hasn't been a straight line. I started in
          cybersecurity, I'm now working toward a computer science
          degree, and eventually I want to build something genuinely
          useful for people — not just something that reads well on a
          resume.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Quotes</h2>
    <div class="quotes-list">
      <blockquote class="quote">
        "A man has two lives. The second one starts when he realizes he
        only has one."
      </blockquote>
      <blockquote class="quote">
        The compass was created before the clock, because direction is
        more important than time.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Skills</h2>

    <h3>Cybersecurity</h3>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">Penetration testing</span>
      <span class="tag">Vulnerability assessment</span>
      <span class="tag">OWASP Top 10</span>
      <span class="tag">Incident response</span>
      <span class="tag">Zero Trust architecture</span>
      <span class="tag">Cloud security (AWS/Azure)</span>
    </div>

    <h3>Workflows & AI implementation</h3>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">LLM agent design</span>
      <span class="tag">Prompt engineering</span>
      <span class="tag">RAG pipelines</span>
      <span class="tag">MCP tooling</span>
      <span class="tag">Process automation (n8n, Zapier)</span>
      <span class="tag">API integration</span>
    </div>

    <h3>Marketing</h3>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">SEO</span>
      <span class="tag">Content strategy</span>
      <span class="tag">Growth marketing</span>
      <span class="tag">Brand positioning</span>
      <span class="tag">Marketing automation</span>
    </div>

    <h3>Communication & direction</h3>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">Public speaking</span>
      <span class="tag">Strategic communication</span>
      <span class="tag">Team leadership</span>
      <span class="tag">Mentoring</span>
      <span class="tag">Conflict resolution</span>
    </div>

    <h3>Computer science (Monash, incoming)</h3>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">Data structures & algorithms</span>
      <span class="tag">Software engineering practices</span>
      <span class="tag">Systems programming</span>
      <span class="tag">Databases</span>
      <span class="tag">Machine learning fundamentals</span>
      <span class="tag">Cloud computing</span>
    </div>

    <p class="meta skills-note">(edit me — this list is a placeholder starting point, swap in what's actually true)</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section contact-section">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <a href="mailto:jaxon.doelling@outlook.com" class="contact-box">
        <span class="contact-label meta">Email</span>
        <span class="contact-value">jaxon.doelling@outlook.com</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/JaxonDoelling" class="contact-box">
        <span class="contact-label meta">GitHub</span>
        <span class="contact-value">@JaxonDoelling</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(140px, 220px) 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .intro-grid h1 {
    position: sticky;
    top: 2rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .bio-text {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .quotes-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .quote {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .tags {
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .contact-section {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .contact-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(47, 143, 255, 0.05);
    transition:
      border-color 0.2s ease,
      box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact-box:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 24px rgba(47, 143, 255, 0.25),
      0 0 4px rgba(47, 143, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .contact-label {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .contact-value {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .intro-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .intro-grid h1 {
      position: static;
    }

    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
